{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50171","headline":"扬子江夜宴（伯三六一九） · 蔡希寂","name":"扬子江夜宴（伯三六一九）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚水夜潮平，仙舟烬烛明。\n美人歌一曲，坐客不胜情。\n罗幕香风倦，纱巾舞袖轻；遨游正得意，云雨莫来迎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蔡希寂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}